OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'appalling'
OL,4,Acatalogue of coercive control and abuse
OL,5,Aagainst partner
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Fand references to suicide and abusive
OL,9,Fbehaviour
OL,11,FA man subjected his partner to an
OL,12,F"appalling" catalogue of abuse,
OL,13,Fincluding beating and abusive messages,
OL,14,Fwhich the judge said was "one of the
OL,15,Fworst" cases of coercive control the
OL,16,Fcourt had seen.
