OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'appalling'
OL,4,Acatalogue of coercive control and abuse
OL,5,Aagainst partner
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Gizzi, 55, from St Asaph,
OL,8,FDenbighshire, was jailed for four years
OL,9,Fand 11 months after pleading guilty to
OL,10,Fcoercive and controlling behaviour
OL,11,Ftowards Natasha Farah, 32, and for
OL,12,Fintentional strangulation of her
OL,13,Fsister.
OL,15,FThere were shouts of "scumbag" and "rot
OL,16,Fin hell" from the public gallery
OL,17,Ftowards Gizzi who appeared at the
OL,18,Fhearing via video link from prison.
